by being a very active member of Huntsville's beautification board and honor her for her

246
00:16:39,100 --> 00:16:42,100
many years of services to our city.

247
00:16:42,100 --> 00:16:48,100
Whereas Ms. Masucci's experience on projects such as the city of Huntsville's beautification

248
00:16:48,100 --> 00:16:55,100
board and event coordinator of the historic Lowry House, along with her mother, Jane Tippett,

249
00:16:55,100 --> 00:16:58,100
positioned her as a pillar of the community.

250
00:16:58,100 --> 00:17:03,100
Her fellow board members enthusiastically stated that she was a joy to work with.

251
00:17:03,100 --> 00:17:09,100
And whereas friends describe Ms. Masucci as a ball of energy, ready to lend a hand, witty

252
00:17:09,100 --> 00:17:16,100
and humorous, she brought love, fun and creativity to every endeavor that she encountered.

253
00:17:16,100 --> 00:17:21,100
Now therefore, be it resolved by the city council and the mayor of the city of Huntsville

254
