1087
01:37:15,660 --> 01:37:18,660
Yes, ma'am. We have similar agreements with Ring.

1088
01:37:18,660 --> 01:37:23,660
Okay, great. I appreciate. I remembered that we were doing that, and so I know that it's

1089
01:37:23,660 --> 01:37:28,660
