1092
01:37:41,660 --> 01:37:46,660
who just commits a robbery. We call them muggers, right? We pick them up on the side or just mug

1093
01:37:46,660 --> 01:37:52,660
somebody. That person's sole source of income was stealing from others. We probably just

1094
01:37:52,660 --> 01:37:58,660
prevented 20 robberies. The quicker you get these people in custody, the lower, the better

1095
01:37:58,660 --> 01:38:05,660
you reduce crime. So getting people in handcuffs quicker reduces crime, and that's where

1096
01:38:05,660 --> 01:38:13,660
technology comes into play. Reducing that time do not allow them to continue this criminal behavior.

1097
01:38:13,660 --> 01:38:18,660
